<title>LITHUANIA: MID-DAY RADIO REPORTS - APRIL 24.</title>
<headline>MID-DAY RADIO REPORTS - APRIL 24.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the main news reports broadcast by Lithuania's M-1 plus radio station at mid-day on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- West European Union (WEU) General Secretary Hose Cutileiro arrived in Vilnius today to sign an agreement between the WEU and Lithuania on the mutual exchange of secret information.</p>
<p>- Lithuania and Belarus begin talks in Vilnius today on a treaty for the readmission of illegal immigrants.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
